Z||000000||Shaun41178||01-11-2001||05:01 PM||||I just moved here to florida and I don't have a jack or jackstands yet.  My starter went out and I have no way of getting the car in the air and keeping it there.  Anyone in the area that has a jack and stands willing to let me borrow them?  Replacement should take less then a day at most and I can have them back to you if you really need them.  Also anyone with a VOM?  i would like to check the voltage of my battery and the continuity of the cables from the starter to the battery to make sure that all is good there as well.  Thanks<P>------------------<BR>Shaun 85 GT with nitrous<BR>0-60 in 5.6 seconds<BR><A HREF="http://members.aol.com/Shaun41178" TARGET=_blank>Preferred Performance</A>||||reg||1
Z||000001||PJ||01-11-2001||05:39 PM||||Did you check the connections at the battery and all the grounds? I've got stands up the wazoo here. I also have a spare starter somewhere. Shop is at 705 W Int Speedway Blvd. E-Mail me at pjsolo@bellsouth.net.<P>Paul<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Shaun41178||01-11-2001||07:35 PM||||Hey pj what is the shop called?  i know where the speedway is at but I don't know where 705 is at.  is it on the north or south side of the street?  <P>yes i did check the connections at the battery and that didn't change anything.  i want to check the cables at the starter too as they could be corroded a bit but i need to get it into the air for that.  I have  a spare starter too its just way up in toledo.<P>Thanks<P>------------------<BR>Shaun 85 GT with nitrous<BR>0-60 in 5.6 seconds<BR><A HREF="http://members.aol.com/Shaun41178" TARGET=_blank>Preferred Performance</A>||||reg||1
Z||000003||PJ||01-11-2001||08:20 PM||||Did you check the grounds? Specifically the other ends of the neg battery cable going to the block/head and the smaller one going to the battery tray support. I've seen these cause a no crank.<P>The shop is behind a print shop called Speedway Press. Its about 3 miles east of the Speedway on the south side. Across from the big U-Haul dealer.<P>If you can get the car there you can work on it out back. If not I can lend you whatever you might need. Call first tho to make sure I'm there. 255-1565, ask for Paul.||||reg||1
