Z||000005||Old Lar||01-12-2001||11:18 AM||||PJ:  Make sure you're available for the Daytona Show in March.  A lot people driving aged Fieros to Florida. Need a shop with tools and experienced mechanics. Three years ago, I blew my alternator while driving on the track, I made it to the Firestone super store for a replacement.  They got it fixed by the next day.  Who knows what may break while I'm a long way from home.||||reg||3
